// expect: refuse E_FootprintExceeded
// A claim of 16 KB cannot hold an arena: a quarter of it is less than the
// least journal an arena can keep, 1,024 entries of 8 bytes, so the journal
// stays at that floor and the start needs more than the claim. The refusal
// says the floor and offers to open no arena.
import arena

fn main() with Footprint(16384) = memory_pages() ~> arena
